                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fa740567-daab-9cec-7f15-e69b1c656e44" id="_fa740567-daab-9cec-7f15-e69b1c656e44"></a>dataSource</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a1b9dfda-c8d1-20bc-f183-de86b6128070" id="_a1b9dfda-c8d1-20bc-f183-de86b6128070"></a>Identification of the kinds of data sources usable to product datasets compliant with the considering specification</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_5e9b1153-7f73-cbdb-13de-8280b9d338b3" id="_5e9b1153-7f73-cbdb-13de-8280b9d338b3"></a>0..*</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e6d466f4-8a00-0692-bcb6-03bc1b70fd9f" id="_e6d466f4-8a00-0692-bcb6-03bc1b70fd9f"></a>CharacterString</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_61f45d8a-35de-9883-8462-4fbb5fd75a92" id="_61f45d8a-35de-9883-8462-4fbb5fd75a92"></a>productionProcess</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1de16ac8-047a-4b2e-8dd1-774223aeec20" id="_1de16ac8-047a-4b2e-8dd1-774223aeec20"></a>Link to a textual description of the production process (including encoding guide) applicable to the datasets compliant with the considering specification</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1212973b-0344-79fa-a6b3-1e8e08a36c0d" id="_1212973b-0344-79fa-a6b3-1e8e08a36c0d"></a>0..*</p>
</td>
                <td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fd4828b3-0c21-5f76-ff39-b077d3f407ed" id="_fd4828b3-0c21-5f76-ff39-b077d3f407ed"></a>CharacterString (URL)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
